{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50108","headline":"游仙窟诗 咏双树荅文成 · 崔十娘","name":"游仙窟诗 咏双树荅文成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂游双树下，遥见两枝芳。\n向日俱翻影，迎风竝散香。\n戏蝶扶丹萼，游蜂入紫房。\n人今总摘取，各着一边箱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔十娘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}